<control id="u1da2a9d5-1014" class="AppControlSection"><graphic language=""><text text="The Cisco 4351 Integrated Services Router (ISR) is the highest performing router in the Cisco 4000 Series, a revolutionary converged branch platform with industry-leading nework compute and WAN services. The ISR 4451 provides up to 2 Gbps performance with a 2-rack unit (2RU) form factor, three NIM slots, and two SM slots. It includes a redundant power supply." html="html"><![CDATA[The Cisco 4351 Integrated Services Router (ISR) is the highest performing router in the Cisco 4000 Series, a revolutionary converged branch platform with industry-leading nework compute and WAN services. The ISR 4451 provides up to 2 Gbps performance with a 2-rack unit (2RU) form factor, three NIM slots, and two SM slots. It includes a redundant power supply.]]></text><field name="section" value="Product Overview"/></graphic>
</control>
<control id="u1da2a9d5-1015" class="AppControlSection"><graphic language=""><text text=" Offers service integration with voice, video, security, data, and embedded services. Internal services plane allows for remote installation of application-aware services without compromise. The Cisco 4351-X enables deployment in high-speed WAN environments with concurrent services enabled up to 2Gbps. The backplane architecture enables high-bandwidth module-to-module communication up to 10 Gbps without compromising router performance. " html="html"><![CDATA[<span class='Bullet'>Offers service integration with voice, video, security, data, and embedded services.</span><br><span class='Bullet'>Internal services plane allows for remote installation of application-aware services without compromise.</span><br><span class='Bullet'>The Cisco 4351-X enables deployment in high-speed WAN environments with concurrent services enabled up to 2Gbps.</span><br><span class='Bullet'>The backplane architecture enables high-bandwidth module-to-module communication up to 10 Gbps without compromising router performance.</span>]]></text><field name="section" value="Product Features"/></graphic>
